# #Misfits Add - Hot air balloon flight console title + RP emotes.
balloon-window-title = Hot Air Balloon Cabin

balloon-rp-startup = begins the slow inflation of its envelope as the burner rumbles.
balloon-rp-startup-switches = checks the mooring lines and basket rigging.
balloon-rp-startup-avionics = opens the burner valves and runs a flame check.
balloon-rp-startup-rotors = watches the canopy swell as hot air fills the envelope.
balloon-rp-startup-throttle = throttles the burner as the balloon strains against its tethers.
balloon-rp-takeoff = rises from the ground in a billow of hot air.
balloon-rp-landing = sinks back toward the earth as the burner falls quiet.
balloon-rp-z-up = climbs toward the sky for cruising.
balloon-rp-z-down = descends toward the ground for low-altitude drift.
balloon-rp-fuel-emergency = sputters as its propane runs dry and begins an emergency descent.
balloon-rp-pilot-disconnected = drifts into an automatic emergency descent as the pilot becomes unresponsive.
